{"v":4,"catch":"操作可愛的小貓咪, 跳往終點吧！","desc":"CAT AND TOWER是一款簡單明瞭的計時動作遊戲！\n玩家將操作小貓咪 「莫伊」，靠著善用移動、跳躍、衝刺，朝向高塔上的終點邁進！\n\n■遊戲特徵\n・找出自己能找到的最佳過關路線，挑戰更新時間！\n・衝刺的使用次數取決於所吃下的點心數量。\n・達成各種的Extra Mssion吧！\n・找出隱藏起來的難易度吧！\n・此遊戲簡單且上手容易，非常適合在空閒時間小玩一下！\n\n此遊戲是由Maker系列中專門製作動作遊戲的軟體「Pixel Game Maker MV」所製作。此遊戲系列均能在Nintendo Switch™上遊玩。","publisher":"Gotcha Gotcha Games","release":"2023-02-02","genres":["街機","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7ffaf9b58cd29d9168fd087a6520d4b2829a8594e6c76548ed448cba99af976d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6240d8d9bc6b6cdad555a7e6ea7a0fc8573f48966fbec4ce9f78bb10c4c9f04.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f43b28fb7f102954a606328c9d831879c9c8dd5cbe551bfba519eef5447a73ef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0291ca05f45cdc410e8bcf4d3688aa1f3eb2a7e3fe4ae18a0925034611716e89.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e48a22cafd2d997d86623a76a4f272e0d590389a4ca677045ce345a34fb8e5ba.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4344b75e9988386c2c5b74fee1f1236d273f99c372fb890770428b43d576614d.jpg"],"titleId":"01005e501a228000","dlc":[]}